Deterministic layer-pattern engine (lib/palletize.ts): exhaustive search over
column, two-block and four-block layer families in both case orientations,
ranked by cases per layer, ties to interlocked layouts. Layer count bounded by
usable height and by payload; result names the binding constraint.

- /tools/pallet-pattern-calculator (en + de), SSR method + FAQ so it ranks with
  JS off; only the instrument is a client island
- SVG plan view, CSV pattern-sheet export, all maths client-side (no case
  dimensions ever leave the browser)
- SoftwareApplication + FAQPage + BreadcrumbList schema, canonical + hreflang
- Linked from home tool band, nav, and the Palletizer OS product page
- Geometry-only disclaimer: explicitly not a load-stability certification

